--- !u!114 &3680097990523748901
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6040233439261877027}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 39494524dd17c314297476e7d6ff65a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - "If you\u2019re taking care of the grave, don\u2019t make it grand. He never
    liked things that tried too hard. He liked simple things. Warm food. A clean
    counter. Knowing someone would be fed before school let out\u2026 That\u2019s
    enough.\u201D"
  - "\u201CPeople think grief is loud. It isn\u2019t. It\u2019s waking up and realizing
    you don\u2019t know what to do with the morning anymore.\u201D"
  - "\u201CYou\u2019re that cleaner from yesterday, yes? Anne told me. Thank you
    for this, he\u2026 I know he\u2019d be grateful too. Reminds me of how he always
    used to pack extra napkins. I also always told him we didn\u2019t need them.
    \u2018Someone always does\u2019, he\u2019d say, you know? I didn\u2019t like
    standing near the stand after school. Convenient for the food. For me. For the
    others. Everyone knew me if they knew him. Now I keep wishing I stayed longer.\u201D"
  - "Witness ; NPC  \u201CI was there earlier. Not when it happened - Before. Two
    people came by. Didn\u2019t buy anything. Just stood too close. I remember thinking
    they were waiting for someone else. I keep wondering what would\u2019ve happened
    if I\u2019d stayed.\u201D "
  dialogueText: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  delayBetweenLines: 1
